WEBVTT

00:06:29.597 --> 00:06:33.930
Today, Gucci sells sneakers
that only exist in the virtual world,

00:06:33.963 --> 00:06:36.263
and you can never wear them,

00:06:36.297 --> 00:06:37.763
but your avatar can.

00:06:37.797 --> 00:06:39.030
Alternatively,

00:06:39.063 --> 00:06:40.597
you can use augmented reality

00:06:40.630 --> 00:06:44.797
to overlay virtual sneakers
onto your in-real-life feet.

00:06:45.163 --> 00:06:46.730
And because of NFTs,

00:06:46.730 --> 00:06:50.130
anyone, not just well-known
companies like Gucci,

00:06:50.163 --> 00:06:56.197
can create digital fashion to be bought,
sold and worn in games,

00:06:56.230 --> 00:06:58.430
online platforms

00:06:58.463 --> 00:07:00.463
and even in avatar fashion shows.